cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the simulator or these scripts, please cite them using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "AgingBrain Simulator"
abstract: >-
  Every published version of the AgingBrain Simulator, from version 1 to
  version 104, together with the scripts that reproduce each panel of the
  figures and supplementary figures of Buckner et al., "Synthesizing and
  Predicting Brain and Cognitive Aging Data Patterns Using an Evolving
  Simulator Enabled by Agentic Artificial Intelligence" (bioRxiv,
  forthcoming). Each version is a single HTML file that runs entirely in a
  web browser.
authors:
  - family-names: Buckner
    given-names: Randy L.
    affiliation: >-
      Center for Brain Science, Harvard University, Cambridge, Massachusetts,
      United States; Athinoula A. Martinos Center for Biomedical Imaging,
      Massachusetts General Hospital, Charlestown, Massachusetts, United
      States; Department of Psychiatry, Massachusetts General Hospital,
      Charlestown, Massachusetts, United States
repository-code: "https://github.com/Buckner-Lab/Aging-Brain-Simulator"
url: "https://buckner-lab.github.io/Aging-Brain-Simulator/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - brain aging
  - cognitive aging
  - Alzheimer's disease
  - simulation
  - agentic artificial intelligence
